--- !u!114 &9097699768971095790
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1822789656951116285}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bd2ba39807b8e0c4d8af972f61294839, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroductionDialogue
  textComponent: {fileID: 7718939584242246419}
  lines:
  - 'INFORMANT: Lady Luck, we''ve spent six months gathering intelligence on this
    operation, have you found anything to prove our suspicions? '
  - 'LadyLuck: Not enough '
  - 'I know something illegal is happening here, but everytime I get close, the trail
    goes cold '
  - 'INFORMANT: I believe you but suspicion isn''t evidence. We can''t launch an
    investigation against the military without proof of illegal operations. '
  - Listen I've arranged a temporary security blackout. The cameras and alarms will
    be down for 5 minutes, THAT'S YOUR WINDOW
  - 'Once they''re back online, they''ll know  someone inside tempered with their
    system '
  - 'LadyLuck: Five minutes? That''s barely enough time '
  - 'INFORMANT: It''s all I can give you '
  - 'And Luck, listen carefully... if they catch you investigating your own unit,
    they"ll charge you with treason and given your rank, you know what that means '
  - 'LadyLuck: Execution '
  - 'IMFORMANT: Exactly, so get the evidence and GET OUT '
  - 'Don''t trust anyone, we still don''t know who''s involved '
  - 'LadyLuck: Understood. I''ll contact you whhen I''m clear. '
  roomline: 2
  textSpeed: 0.1
